  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "d7da9372-381a-4718-a2a5-27dbdd11418b",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol ao apoio em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "9cf5b8e8-c563-4595-9a71-faa9253d7086",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a cena, escute e acompanhe a frase.</p><p><strong>Yo suelo inclinarme por el cine intimista.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Eu costumo me inclinar mais por um cinema intimista.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a5b71a23197d4c44a77fd11a03c41c1f_b01-comparando-posters-cine.png?Expires=1794099696&Signature=FSMQ238SbetJFJ5GJ0mzufzIXbPvEQL0wPJG~51vycI28pcAaFQz1IqdG8Fuwz0X5o49sHkwCbAAxmsiXpNIUzviIKZwdG-W7325CuZbd4NRkMGYUX8jphxL~4DFRQCOJS9tBR~YjNfwT9ifajiaLQHGMh6hX4gQWF-yOL45Qp4otjIjK9b1gVv0cb6nJ~~6gu-t0Y1Tr5muSyPofFtZ8xNKCEH-qpM6tsAS5wDIDinoW8kliqHUOxprZs3tw7eCxe22HIeYgoKhQ-GY4i9dKcfkAcOHHBpxqYvFwVs3OyxvsUO66Bo3mPlKuiUsS0yYsDUl5SoVxtsUJ-PGweG9eQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/2a14e50bc14d4b618ee260d57165008b_b01-yo-suelo-inclinarme-por-el-cine-intimista.mp3?Expires=1794099696&Signature=RtppRuIzQGhg5ZzdNeLKJcn22ztAE~8fWuiHmb8DuwYt3Koc-8NY6BStziTbRWJzqP-eeQkKbo1rBhcxQnsZ-9tWAgdWR0r0iR2s6k3rhTMjWqnbKa~5kWduPllRHgFrVtfAQrNWkP36EYopHfqzlOIURFhN684nqHPjsCB376j2VPTUFhm0n0xzc-sggcDtZBCDgt8Hq7ctzM80wa2Je6ptSvTx568o9GezgMzRj0w2ID~o8S2b8wVk48y1oe7fk4a2wbx7M1Jt1Yd4B1fTjhFHNIWEKOXh77vQ-JYm75PprefeyhtKwQW35uum~k0nJKXEr3fayTXL0zjyKTpt-g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
