    {
      "id": "dbd7068b-e9b4-467b-8ca6-a0a0477a7099",
      "title": "Leia a nota e repare em como a frase evita generalizacoes absolutas.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ed5696d3-e105-457b-a233-e140a6392ff8",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>la mayoría</strong> ajuda a falar de tendência coletiva sem dizer que todo mundo pensa igual.</p><p>Isso é útil quando você compara amigos, família, colegas ou gerações.</p><p>A frase fica mais precisa porque admite exceções e ainda mostra um padrão real.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "01b6a46f-cb2c-4699-bb6e-9e5c3fdf1f47",
      "title": "Quando os gostos não batem de primeira",
      "description": "<p>As falas retomam as três molduras centrais da aula e mostram como elas entram numa conversa curta antes de uma escolha conjunta.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Yo suelo inclinarme por el cine intimista.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Eu costumo me inclinar mais por um cinema intimista.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/316f2b191175424ebcd5a1e72eca364d_b01-yo-suelo-inclinarme-por-el-cine-intimista.mp3?Expires=1794099696&Signature=ieqKHJBZQy3eUZq7C8-LHd20fDMBciiI6A5uVWAUyL8RlyE7SSmq7Aa0N1a30Z2FQ9LwIGdPTkXiRDilr-uRxB~Re5TEUPTPLGShDwWnZhFGc2hSdjHzWz-xDPTTxeSy~RYsUq6l5axU9SfPkKTc0WoVrnTcJjNioxMxjYl-A9SvFHGhgqDJPjIVn~aUvimyjZFSIU7MK4ytrCK5kS3gv3ybHMIyP8sd4AenNgwkMvuOkTUvmp0fXwOiEgEg7Gw68ZSvu4LlU5dBxXY5B0egDgW2k6uteJkAqD45x-UqBj49ZvTdnEmMq2DEqVgcDg-7PpVX9xyo9y40Jt2GM7OpZw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">En cambio, yo prefiero las historias más directas.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Já eu prefiro histórias mais diretas.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/bb6b1d5abbe740eea4b0be7760229e35_b03-en-cambio-yo-prefiero-las-historias-mas-directas.mp3?Expires=1794099696&Signature=OTAM13cFtCFgl2JNLquFAruxZt8C3oZ-xQdziwo~Dh1ccvE88C6HV4a3em9dUCGiug-QjkC07Qau-ZYs54xxa-qpBJH21zsAMd0IbSdFkwS9BS~TS9QkEERRxpk064fv9F6t-3xdl0Ye5cgQeGbGrlZl3RwJL1MRR09GMI2qU59c1aKxDviUpAtus9OhOAB9u8cj-dESdpTxYGw-MxtbTzXELj8OpRmukG9mapYji6NJCi7At6udKAsEMfJhswPC8jEby8WSz0kekXdwBCoMQdpFKQ9QlvzX87~T7qNGkRSsk86u6pEymyrLF-kulqgmjS0s0Ws~DqVEyXMi0DvGxQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">En mi grupo, la mayoría se inclina más por los documentales sociales.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">No meu grupo, a maioria tende mais aos documentários sociais.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/43608e488b2a4fc2881397da69071f41_b05-en-mi-grupo-la-mayoria-se-inclina-mas-por-los-documentales-sociales.mp3?Expires=1794099696&Signature=CgNLf3d9jwlTyvgi83eoWWUAgRJs~cMg~dMszD0mvk7KtGn1qmlcG312VqZcONBznjeLDo3yQclo~CVPDwEWbvv0p8lSR4QaiuzX~z-M5DXL6PYmzisFrdn33~LRquacx9YeKNZ1s2EIHqq4wGzHaHlk32h0yZReVW84sPBFkM8K79h~iGroxZz-00PkEtTqWNVcpGa6iRNP7xXA0whM1K91n0ndPTzDZgpCKmJ9PboCnNWEgHvA0hT3qV2bdolQrZbrFfPMbPgXQG2ZsFbQexo~jAD-3QZpK1QgiGdwW601IXKsupMNMdVYxu2CZIhg~SDmXn86uzfWezyExMLEUw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Por eso, cuando elegimos algo juntos, tenemos que alternar.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Por isso, quando escolhemos algo juntos, temos que alternar.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/74264df55b1447949a0c7e9253cc6c80_b07-linea-04-por-eso-tenemos-que-alternar.mp3?Expires=1794099696&Signature=Ti2KT-HMVqBQSmyiw~WO4gM-SLzYmrTiUSChGhJmJWa0oEXtLdpnDA5YaATj4ax34OGfrCDs~3rWPF-iPiSGzRT3ZAR63GTMgWU2avqjoeuT1MeBgZEU0BfvCXQ~sUE7K9fqcyCQJagSabUzxjrncv2MA192uCBvQWMXSkkRG9jsgCMJzENJzVx6G8gxLlShXQrxKE9gbzuyijZkLEyskg-MSWu~7kj6uySC6PJZ2rkbIIGlVjN5KrUH0KUGP6~x4m12pCqmWVT9f0xsfLmwgSNMcSaBJ132fC9vY0mg0JmYAMWQEHQGd08Rn5AReQcxeuopD99vkbQjI2~iGmQWPw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        }
